Z||000000||JetroGT||05-30-2000||12:11 AM||||Well, I've been here for about two weeks. The temps are mostly 90's with he!!ish trafic. Other than that, the people are nice. Before I left Wisconsin I gave away my spare Fiero parts. It was better than seeing them go in the trash. I left Wisconsin 5/18 at about 2pm drove untill 7a.m. when I pulled into corprate housing near Beach street. The only bad thing about driving down was that I hit a piece of retred going through Missouri. The thing was huge! I swear my Fiero got air borne. Before I left I had my air charged. Now I have no air. That piece of retred messed up my cooling lines in the front. Now I got it over at the some small shop across the street from Service King. Some guy named Hoss is working on it. My other fiero is still being shiped. So if you see black SE with white skunk stripes or a 87 blue GT, that's probably me. ||||reg||10
